{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12205080","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12205080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1220508001:1":{"text":"怒ったブタがほかの子ブタを驚かせちゃったんだ。","source_cn":"完蛋了……那只发怒的猪把其它小猪都吓跑了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF50C2375B79172A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220508002:1":{"text":"落ち着いて！あの方角……ブタたちは村に帰っていったのかも。","source_cn":"先别紧张！看它们跑的方向，像是回村里去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4C9159B024B8CDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220508003:1":{"text":"ロンロン、この怒ったブタをなだめる方法はある？","source_cn":"满满，你有办法制服这只大猪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7729F981028A8876","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220508004:1":{"text":"えぇっ！？ロンロンは動物のしつけなんてできないよ！","source_cn":"哎——？！可满满不会驯兽啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61C654BA495936F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220508005:1":{"text":"それなら、まずはブタの飼い主にいい手がないか聞いてみる？","source_cn":"要不然，我们先回去问问它的主人有没有驯服的办法？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35424503A9BB06D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_s